{
  "slug": "alfred",
  "name": "Alfred",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Alfred teaches 8 development habits using domain-specific language from 7 professional personas (ML/Data Science, Research, Business Analytics, Product Analytics, Data Platform, General, Writer/Editor). It explains concepts once using your domain's analogies, then goes silent as you learn. Your corrections automatically harden into permanent CLAUDE.md rules and then into automated hooks that enforce them. Install, run /alfred:bootstrap, answer 3 questions, and start working.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **19 commands** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `collective-contribute` (Use when the user wants to preview or contribute anonymized learning signals to the collective), `persona-evolve` (Use during self-improve to automatically evolve the user persona based on accumulated corrections and usage patterns), `persona-management` (Use when the user wants to view, modify, or reset their Alfred persona, or when running /persona), `smart-suggestions` (Contextual recommendations for every Alfred command — when to suggest, what to say, and why), `using-alfred` (Use when starting any session with Alfred installed to orient the user and check onboarding state)\n- **Commands** (19): `audit`, `bootstrap`, `ci-fix`, `collective`, `commit`, `experiment-summary`, `github-account-setup`, `health-check`, and 11 more\n- **Hooks** (4): `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`, `Stop`, `PreCompact`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install alfred@claude-community` from `DrakeCaraker/alfred`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
